---
description: Conventional Commits + husky gates (commitlint scopes)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commits

```text
type(scope): summary
```

- **type:** feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
- **scope (required):** api | pms | web | packages | repo | deps
- Imperative summary, no trailing period, header/body lines ≤ 300 chars

Hooks (do not `--no-verify` unless user asks):
- `pre-commit` → `pnpm typecheck`
- `commit-msg` → commitlint
